    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nIntroducing No. 10 The Pine, Trimbleston to the market, a beautifully presented two-bedroom upper-floor apartment enjoying an abundance of natural light throughout and overlooking exceptionally well-maintained communal gardens within this highly sought-after development in Goatstown. This fine apartment comes fully furnished, if desired and offers a wonderful opportunity for a first time buyer or investor looking for something ready to go!\n\nExtending to approximately 80.5 sq.m., the accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall with a generous storage room. This leads through to a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, designed for modern living and entertaining. The living space is enhanced by a striking floor-to-ceiling window overlooking the front of the development and offers direct access to a private balcony.\n\nThe principal bedroom is a generously proportioned double room with access to the balcony and the added benefit of an en-suite bathroom. The second bedroom, also a double room and enjoys pleasant views over the beautifully landscaped communal grounds. The accommodation offers two designated parking spaces, securely located within the underground car park.\n\nConveniently located off the Goatstown Road, No.10 enjoys an array of local shops, eateries, educational facilities and sporting amenities within walking distance. The development is exceptionally well served by public transport, with bus routes located directly outside the development, providing swift and easy access to Dublin City Centre, UCD and Dundrum Town Centre.\n\nThis property is sure to appeal to a broad spectrum of buyers, including those looking to right-size, first-time purchasers, and investors seeking to benefit from the area's strong and consistent rental demand."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWooden flooring and recessed lighting. Includes intercom and storage room with hanging space.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.30m x 3.40m\nDouble room with fitted wardrobes and wooden flooring. Window overlooking the front of the property and door providing access to the balcony.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.90m x 1.70m\nTiled flooring and partially tiled walls, walk-in power shower unit, Pharaoh's toilet and wash-hand basin, glass shelf and mounted mirror. Includes extractor fan and shelf unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.40m x 3.40m\nDouble room with window overlooking the front of the property. Fitted wooden wardrobe and wooden floors.\n\nBathroom - 1.90m x 2.10m\nTiled flooring and walls, Pharaoh's toilet and wash-hand basin, mounted glass shelf, mirror and LED light, extractor fan, bath with overhead shower attachment and wall mounted mirror. Includes shelf unit.\n\nLiving Room/Kitchen - 5.30m x 9.16m\nWooden flooring and recessed lighting. Large window overlooking the communal gardens and natural stone fireplace with Dimplex electric inset. Built-in wooden kitchen units with marble countertop, incorporating integrated appliances such as NEFF oven, four-ring gas hob and extractor fan.\n\nBalcony - 1.5m x 5.2m\nTiled flooring and glass screen with stainless steel railing.\n\n"
      },
